    "media:imagetext": "-Share in the Spirit. Tradition and Cersprony\nThe Sydney 2000 Olympic Games take place\nfrom 15 September to 1 October, 2000 and will\nbe the largest cultural sporting event yet seen\non this planet. Air New Zealand is a member of\nthe Official Airline Team, bringing athletes and\ntravellers to Australia to participate in and\nwitness remarkable displays of teamwork,\nstrength and determination. Together, the team\nwill bring the world to Sydney to celebrate this\nmost enduring and admirable event of all time.\nPACIFIC\nCLASS",
